ull length, not quite joining the vertical; rho is closed; alpha broad with straight bar; sigma has horizontal top and bottom bars, joined by a curving stroke rather than two distinct diagonals; omega sits very slightly above the line, is circular and open with short arms",[453,454],{"type":58,"l":59,"from":60,"to":60,"h":63,"unit":62,"atLeast":63,"atMost":63},{"type":66,"l":67,"from":60,"to":68,"h":69,"unit":62},{"_":456,"notBefore":457,"notAfter":458,"evidence":459},"Dated to the end of the 4th century BCE by the burial goods",-325,-301,"archaeological-context",[461,462],{"_":76,"type":77,"ref":78,"region":79},{"_":81,"type":82,"ref":83,"offset":84,"region":79},[464],[87,88],[90,91],{"_":467,"role":96,"ref":468},"Museo Archeologico Santi Furnari di Tripi","http://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/museum/177",{"_":470,"type":100},"ME23435",{"_":102,"mainLang":103,"languages":472},[102],[474],{"atLeast":107,"atMost":107},[416,476,114,477],"Bacci, Coppolino, Sofia, Arizia, 2015, Tripi. Il museo archeologico \"Santi Furnari\". Guida all'esposizione","Sofia, 2018, Nuove iscrizioni funerarie dalla necropoli di Abakainon",[420,479,120,480],"ILQ4RQGU","JQQKI6JP",[482,483,484,32,36,40,125,126,127,128,126,485,131,103],"isic004411","epitaph for kratisstos",{"_":209},"museo archeologico santi furnari di tripi","\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  \u003Ca id=\"al1-interpretive\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>Κρατίσστω \u003C/span>\u003C/div>  \u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>",{"author":3,"date":4,"citedRange":488,"ptr":489,"ref":490,"inscriptionDate":4,"title":2,"citation":5,"uri":6,"year":4},"113 fig.115",{"target":136},{"_":138,"target":138},{"file":492,"uri":492,"title":493,"status":494,"editions":495,"editionAuthor":30,"type":501,"objectType":502,"material":506,"condition":46,"layoutDesc":508,"handNote":512,"date":517,"places":521,"geo":525,"country":79,"provenance":76,"provenanceGeo":52